Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Avengers:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.76,0:00:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Endgame reportedly cost 356 million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.54,0:00:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What did it need back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.25,0:00:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Avengers:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Doomsday hits theatres this December.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.55,0:00:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Every record will trend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.47,0:00:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Records are not profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Most fans think ticket money goes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,to the studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.23,0:00:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It made the film,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.63,0:00:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Theatres keep roughly half of every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.19,0:00:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,In China,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.47,0:00:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,foreign studios reportedly get only a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.54,0:00:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And that budget only made the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.55,0:00:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,film.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Marketing reportedly cost about the same
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.75,0:00:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.65,0:00:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Analysts' rule:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,a big film must earn 2.5
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,times its budget,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,just to break even.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Endgame crossed that easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.69,0:00:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,reportedly making Disney a huge profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,For Doomsday,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,ask one thing:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.70,0:00:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,how many times its budget?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Send this to the friend who
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,thinks box office means profit.
